E. Interpretation
  Positive measure is not yet a proof certificate; exact wall signatures are closer.
  The audited windows are bounded by small combinations of even walls and odd branch walls.
  This suggests a finite certificate lemma: every covering row has a survivor window
  whose left/right labels come from a bounded wall alphabet, or else a named owner
  current, sheet, exact-period, or state-lift debt is emitted.

